          "short": "$(x+4-\\sqrt{2})(x+4+\\sqrt{2})$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x+4)^2-2&=(x+4)^2-(\\sqrt{2})^2\\\\(x+4)^2-2&=(x+4-\\sqrt{2})(x+4+\\sqrt{2})\\end{align*}$$",
