          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x-3)^2-5&=(x-3)^2-(\\sqrt{5})^2\\\\(x-3)^2-5&=(x-3-\\sqrt{5})(x-3+\\sqrt{5})\\end{align*}$$",
